---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About moonine - Philosophy of Vedic Astrology Matchmaking" description="Learn how moonine uses the traditional 36-point Ashta Koota system, Guna Milan, and planetary alignments to help you find your celestial partner.">
    <style>
        .guide-section {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        .guide-section h1 {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: none;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-family: var(--font-secondary);
            font-size: var(--font-2xl);
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .guide-section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: none;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--bumble-text);
            font-family: var(--font-secondary);
            font-size: var(--font-xl);
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .step-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 2px solid var(--bumble-border);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(143,118,99,0.01);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .step-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--bumble-yellow);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .tagline {
            display: block;
            font-size: var(--font-xs);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--bumble-text-light);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }
        .step-number {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: var(--bumble-yellow);
            color: var(--bumble-text);
            border: 2px solid var(--bumble-yellow);
            border-radius: 50%;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-right: 0.75rem;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--bumble-yellow);
        }
        .contact-box {
            background: var(--bumble-cream);
            border: 2px dashed var(--bumble-yellow);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .contact-link {
            color: #b59a83;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .contact-link:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
    </style>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h1>The moonine Philosophy</h1>
        <p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: var(--bumble-text-light); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;">Vedic Wisdom, Modern Connections</p>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: var(--font-base); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 650px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
            We bridge ancient Vedic compatibility and modern matchmaking. By rejecting casual swipes, moonine offers a trustworthy, polite space for genuine, lifelong alignment.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Why moonine?</h2>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">Celestial Harmony, Deeply Calculated</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Ashta Koota Matching:</strong>
                Every match undergoes high-precision 36-point Guna Milan (evaluating Varna, Nadi, and Gana) with automated detection of key Doshas to ensure true, lasting harmony.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">Genuine, Gracious & Secure</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Polite Human Verification:</strong>
                We eliminate spam and bots. Every profile is manually vetted, and introductions are facilitated politely and securely.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Our Simple 3-Step Journey</h2>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">Step 1: Discover Alignment</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <span class="step-number">1</span>
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Explore Profiles:</strong>
                Browse verified profiles sorted by their astrological compatibility score.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">Step 2: Express Interest Safely</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <span class="step-number">2</span>
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Send an Email:</strong>
                Email the User ID of your preferred match to <a href="mailto:rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com" style="color: var(--bumble-text); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline;">rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">Step 3: Gentle Introduction</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <span class="step-number">3</span>
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Mutual Choice:</strong>
                We politely check with them, coordinating a secure introduction only after mutual consent.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>A Trustworthy Experience</h2>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">Simple & Reliable Security</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Secure Logins:</strong>
                Access your profile securely using your 10-digit mobile number and private 4-digit PIN.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
            <span class="tagline">Mindful & Precise Math</span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500;">
                <strong style="font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text);">Calculations Latency:</strong>
                Computing detailed planetary degrees and 36-point compatibility can take a moment. We appreciate your mindful patience.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div class="contact-box">
            <p style="font-size: var(--font-lg); font-weight: 800; color: var(--bumble-text); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em;">Ready to find your celestial alignment?</p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--bumble-text); line-height: 1.5;">
                Join a polite, values-driven community today. For inquiries, feel free to contact <strong style="font-weight: 800;">Rahul Bali</strong> at <a href="mailto:rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com" class="contact-link">rahulbaliastrology@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>
            <a href="/create-profile" style="display: inline-block; background: var(--bumble-yellow); color: var(--bumble-text); padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid var(--bumble-yellow); box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--bumble-yellow); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Create Profile & View Matches</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;">
        <div class="logo logo-sm" data-text="moonine" style="margin-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;"><span class="logo-text" style="color: var(--bumble-text);">moonine</span></div>
    </div>

</Layout>
